# RM Tiling — environment variables
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development, or set these in your host
# (e.g. Vercel project settings) for production. All are OPTIONAL.
#
# If CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL or RESEND_API_KEY is not configured, production quote
# requests use a prefilled mailto fallback to the email in src/lib/site.ts.
# Configure one delivery method below for the smoothest customer experience.

# --- Contact form delivery (choose ONE) -----------------------------------

# Option A: POST each enquiry as JSON to any production HTTPS webhook
# (Zapier, Make, a Slack/Discord incoming webhook, your own endpoint, ...)
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Option B: Send enquiries by email via Resend (https://resend.com)
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=info@rmtiling.com.au
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL="RM Tiling <quotes@rmtiling.com.au>"
